real-time data. For brands, Genius Sports drives fan engagement through creative, sports-centric media buying, gamification and sports technology, for example ads built on live scores and match stats. The company also provides sportsbook operators with data, algorithms and risk management tools.', 'Аналітика спортивних даних для команд і ліг
